                                                "sense_id": "2930bf6b-e730-3e56-87b9-34bf91f8515a",
                                                "text": "Somewhere in the cosmos, he said, […] there was also a planet entirely given over to Biro life forms. […] Veet Voogajig suddenly claimed to have found this planet, and to have worked there for a while driving a limousine for a family of cheap green retractables […]"
